{"question":"Comment je trouve les zéros de f(x) = -(x - 2)^2 + 3 ?","note":"Leçon jouée sur /dev le 2026-11-09 (essai réel, code 4fd5ae9), récupérée dans la mémoire de la page. Récapitulatif final sur tableau vide : idea et resume jamais montrés, caméra dirigée vers eux.","lesson":{"id":"zeros_forme_canonique","title":"Trouver les zéros de f(x) = −(x − 2)² + 3","language":"fr","learning_goal":"Résoudre f(x) = 0 pour une parabole en forme canonique et lire les zéros sur l'axe des x."},"math_context":{"symbols":{},"expressions":{}},"slices":[{"slice_id":"s_lire","introduces":[{"id":"regle","content":"f(x) = -(x - 2)^2 + 3","parts":[{"id":"p_fx","text":"f(x) ="},{"id":"p_carre","text":"-(x - 2)^2"},{"id":"p_plus","text":"+ 3"}],"type":"math"},{"id":"rep","params":{"x":[-2,6],"y":[-6,4]},"type":"axes"},{"id":"courbe","style":{"role":"accent"},"params":{"expression":"-(x-2)^2+3","domain":[-1,5]},"type":"function_graph"},{"id":"sommet","style":{"role":"neutral"},"params":{"at":[2,3]},"type":"point"},{"id":"lab_sommet","attachment":{"parent":"sommet","anchor":"top"},"content":"S(2 ; 3)","type":"label"}],"beats":[{"id":"pose","say":"Tu veux les zéros de f de x égale moins, parenthèse x moins deux, au carré, plus trois.","cues":[{"id":"c_regle","text":"f de x égale"}],"do":[{"id":"w_fx","verb":"write","at":"cue:c_regle","target":"regle","part":"p_fx"},{"id":"w_carre","verb":"write","at":"after:w_fx","target":"regle","part":"p_carre"},{"id":"w_plus","verb":"write","at":"after:w_carre","target":"regle","part":"p_plus"}]},{"id":"forme","say":"C'est la forme canonique : le sommet est à deux, trois, et le moins devant le carré ouvre la parabole vers le bas.","cues":[{"id":"c_forme","text":"forme canonique"},{"id":"c_sommet","text":"sommet"},{"id":"c_bas","text":"vers le bas"}],"do":[{"id":"s_rep","verb":"show","at":"cue:c_forme","target":"rep"},{"id":"d_courbe","verb":"draw","start":"cue:c_sommet","end":"cue_end:c_bas","target":"courbe"},{"id":"s_sommet","verb":"show","at":"afte